{"id":"53c4f439c97d8ab1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program.md","title":"Arithmetic Straight-Line Programs","display":"df-arithmetic-straight-line-program — Arithmetic Straight-Line Programs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program","aliases":["28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program"],"display":"df-arithmetic-straight-line-program — Arithmetic Straight-Line Programs","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.2","source_printed_pages":"319–320","source_pdf_pages":"345–346","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-straight-line-program — Arithmetic Straight-Line Programs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 16.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"319–320"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"345–346"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_k)\\in\\mathbb F^k\">\\(c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_k)\\in\\mathbb F^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\ge1\">\\(T\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1,\\ldots,X_n\">\\(X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span> 的形式不定元，源寄存器和全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_i\">\\(y_i\\)</span> 取值于此多项式环。</li>\n<li>源寄存器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_1=X_1,\\ldots,z_n=X_n,z_{n+j}=c_j\">\\(z_1=X_1,\\ldots,z_n=X_n,z_{n+j}=c_j\\)</span>；程序候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=((a_i,b_i,\\circ_i))_{i=1}^T\">\\(P=((a_i,b_i,\\circ_i))_{i=1}^T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i,b_i\\in[n+k+i-1]\">\\(a_i,b_i\\in[n+k+i-1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_i\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\">\\(\\circ_i\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y_i\\coloneqq z_{a_i}\\circ_i z_{b_i},\\qquad z_{n+k+i}\\coloneqq y_i\\quad(i=1,\\ldots,T),\\qquad\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\coloneqq y_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y_i\\coloneqq z_{a_i}\\circ_i z_{b_i},\\qquad z_{n+k+i}\\coloneqq y_i\\quad(i=1,\\ldots,T),\\qquad\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\coloneqq y_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)\\coloneqq\\{(c,P):k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c\\in\\mathbb F^k,\\ P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^T([n+k+i-1]^2\\times\\{+,\\times\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)\\coloneqq\\{(c,P):k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c\\in\\mathbb F^k,\\ P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^T([n+k+i-1]^2\\times\\{+,\\times\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>寄存器编号严格指向已给输入、常量或先前结果，保证求值归纳良定义。重复输入编号允许平方；无分支、无除法，输出是形式多项式。长度计运算语句数，与既有算术电路的全顶点asize区别明确。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 16.2；印刷页 319–320；PDF 页 345–346。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Arithmetic Straight-Line Programs，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R7复核：Definition 16.2（PDF345–346）仅含加法/乘法；本条形式寄存器的多项式环与不定元现在在Hypothesis中明示，按编号递归唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_k)\\in\\mathbb F^k","display":false},{"tex":"T\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"X_1,\\ldots,X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"y_i","display":false},{"tex":"z_1=X_1,\\ldots,z_n=X_n,z_{n+j}=c_j","display":false},{"tex":"P=((a_i,b_i,\\circ_i))_{i=1}^T","display":false},{"tex":"a_i,b_i\\in[n+k+i-1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ_i\\in\\{+,\\times\\}","display":false},{"tex":"y_i\\coloneqq z_{a_i}\\circ_i z_{b_i},\\qquad z_{n+k+i}\\coloneqq y_i\\quad(i=1,\\ldots,T),\\qquad\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\coloneqq y_T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)\\coloneqq\\{(c,P):k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c\\in\\mathbb F^k,\\ P\\in\\prod_{i=1}^T([n+k+i-1]^2\\times\\{+,\\times\\})\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac33b72c805f1644","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb F$ 为域，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$(c,P)\\in\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)$，$y_i$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]；所有寄存器解释为 $\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]$ 中元素；$\\deg0=0$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straig